  ctx.fillStyle = pal.hair;
  beginPath ellipse(-0.4, hy-0.4, 5.7, 6.2, 0,0,TAU) fill

  // Face
  const faceGrad vertical skin
  ellipse(1.1, hy+0.2, 4.4, 5.1)
  // cheek shade
  ...
  // ear
  // eye
  // brow
  // nose/mouth
  // kind headwear
}
```

Careful with dead eyes: closed lines. If dead draw X or line.

Player:
- hair topknot: ellipse(-0.2,hy-6.8,1.6,2.4) with tie trim.
- hairband: path along forehead from (-4,hy-2.2) to (4.5,hy-2.6) stroke trim width 1.4.
- hair strands: bezier from (-4,hy-3) back to (-7,hy+1).
- face scarf? no.

Ronin:
- straw hat: brim wide ellipse at hy-3.6, rx 10.5, ry 2.1, color '#6b5838'; top cone path from (-5,hy-4) to (0,hy-12) to (5,hy-4) fill '#7a6744'; band dark line; highlight.
- shadow over forehead.
- maybe stubble.

Ninja:
- hood: ellipse around head larger in robe2; face mask lower half in robe3 or dark; eye slit with skin around eye? draw pale eye. forehead band accent.
- head wrap tails? small.

Brute:
- helmet: metal cap ellipse top half, color '#3a3439'; rim band accent; horns/ears.
- bald/face scar.

Boss:
- long hair flowing behind; crown: gold band across forehead, two curved horns from sides going up; glowing eyes.
- beard maybe.

